flats.description_en:
Nice 2-room apartment in Gundeli, near Basel SBB station,
for rent from 1. December,
we are renting out a characterful old-building apartment on the 1st floor with a covered balcony facing the quiet, sunny back courtyard, which can also be used jointly. The apartment is functionally furnished and has nice parquet floors; a cellar compartment belongs to the apartment, there is a shared Waschküche (shared laundry room) and a covered bike shelter in the back courtyard. If interested, please get in touch by phone at 079 410 82 93, thank you!
